[00:00.00] 作曲 : Joybeth Taylor/Johnny Clawson
[00:00.00][by:Lucas_DemissyX]
[00:16.82]Nothin' but a dusty dive in Somewhere, Oklahoma
[00:16.82]这家酒馆 坐落于一座俄克拉荷马的无名小镇
[00:23.53]Wouldn't know it passin' by if someone hadn't told ya
[00:23.53]它毫不起眼 仿佛不存在一样
[00:30.17]Only from around here's walkin' in
[00:30.17]只有住在附近的人才会光顾这里
[00:36.79]Wearin' denim head-to-toe, a cowboy Cassanova
[00:36.79]一身牛仔的他 是这里出名的浪荡子
[00:43.55]Comes in every Saturday, and everybody knows him
[00:43.55]每周六他都会走进这里 酒馆里人人都认识他
[00:50.07]And he knows everybody walkin' in
[00:50.07]他也与每位客人都相知相识
[00:56.77]So think of what he thought when she did
[00:56.77]你能想象 当他看到她走进大门时的心情吗
[01:03.14]
[01:04.21]She wasn't from around here, outfit showed
[01:04.21]她不是这里的人 从她那身衣装就能看出来
[01:07.40]She spoke a different accent, everybody spoke
[01:07.40]她的口音和酒馆里的其他人都不一样
[01:10.91]Sittin' on a barstool, keepin' to herself
[01:10.91]她独自一人 安静地坐在吧台高脚凳上
[01:13.98]Didn't order from the top, didn't drink from the well
[01:13.98]她不喝昂贵的威士忌 也不饮私酿月光酒
[01:17.51]She wantеd somethin' red in a tall stem glass
[01:17.51]她只想来一杯高脚杯里的葡萄红
[01:20.83]Hе didn't catch her name, she was gone in a flash
[01:20.83]还没等他记住她的名字 她就已经转身离开
[01:24.22]Left him wantin' more than what he had
[01:24.22]只留他在原地 满腔惆怅渴望
[01:27.57]That one night with the girl who drank wine
[01:27.57]他多想 与那位饮红酒的女士再共度一晚
[01:34.13]
[01:35.04]He tried to throw the same old lines, but dammit, she was witty
[01:35.04]他试着用自己往常的伎俩搭讪 但却被她一下识破
[01:41.66]She said, "I've heard that once or twice, you coulda just said I'm pretty"
[01:41.66]她说 “我早就听过这些甜言蜜语了 能不能直接点”
[01:48.42]She wasn't his same old cup of tea
[01:48.42]她与他见过的女人都不一样
[01:55.11]Unlike anything he'd ever seen
[01:55.11]让他又一次有了新鲜感
